} :answer/value "⟨3,0,3⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336213} {:answer/id #uuid "14870064-b7e8-54d0-99ca-4b64bfe2bd62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨3,0,4⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336226} {:answer/id #uuid "2c7f5521-fd3a-51c7-9ecf-a3af94ee1454" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨1,-1,1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336454} {:answer/id #uuid "6249715c-fc3f-56fb-9993-32d1a515b62a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨4,0,-3⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336915} {:answer/id #uuid "c671655c-abd1-563c-aef5-4ee4cece1841" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨4,1,-3⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337791}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186337791} :answer-field/id #uuid "be9468de-a381-56af-b583-e970a0ac913c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338618}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3cd142bb-0e37-5169-9871-c05d6282caa6" :question/math-academy-id "q-70974" :question/problem "Find a normal vector to the plane\n\n$$\nr=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 12 \\\\ \\frac{3}{4}\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+s\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,t,\\,s\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" :question/worked-solution "From the parametric equation, we have that $v=⟨3,0,4⟩$ and $w=⟨1,-1,1⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\times \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =4i+j-3k \\\\  & =⟨4,1,-3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨4,1,-3⟩.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186391682 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/